{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"git diff --check && git status --short && sed -n '1,240p' reviews/P50U-ultraweak-normality-bridge-closeout.md\"","aggregated_output":" M PLAN.md\n M aristotle_tasks/P49-finite-corner-trace.md\n M aristotle_tasks/P50-normal-faithful-corner-trace.md\n M aristotle_tasks/P51-full-finite-corner-central-exclusion.md\n M work/TWO-LANE-FORMALIZATION-DECISION.md\n?? AristotleCandidates/FiniteCornerTrace.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/FullFiniteCornerCentralExclusion.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/KaplanskyDensity.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/LocalHyperbolicAlgebraicAlpha.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/MixedUHFHyperfiniteFactor.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/NormalFaithfulCornerTrace.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/StrongOperatorClosedVonNeumann.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/UltraweakNormality.lean\n?? AristotleCandidates/VonNeumannBicommutantTheorem.lean\n?? aristotle_tasks/P50U-ultraweak-normality-bridge.md\n?? reviews/P49-finite-corner-trace-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P49-finite-corner-trace-recovery.md\n?? reviews/P49A-strong-operator-closed-von-neumann-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P49B-von-neumann-bicommutant-theorem-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P49C-kaplansky-density-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P50-normal-faithful-corner-trace-closeout-rerun.md\n?? reviews/P50-normal-faithful-corner-trace-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P50-normal-faithful-corner-trace-recovery.md\n?? reviews/P50U-ultraweak-normality-bridge-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P51-full-finite-corner-central-exclusion-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P51-full-finite-corner-central-exclusion-recovery.md\n?? reviews/P53-local-hyperbolic-algebraic-alpha-closeout.md\n?? reviews/P58-mixed-uhf-hyperfinite-factor-closeout.md\n# P50U closeout review — ultraweak topology and normality bridge\n\n## Decision\n\n**Status: accepted; shared infrastructure gate discharged and the queue may\nadvance.**\n\nThe exact task archive\n`aristotle_responses/P50U-ultraweak-normality-bri